  {
   "id": "cubic-cosmos-348835@1.1.0",
   "gameId": "cubic-cosmos-348835",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.1.0",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-07-17T09:13:53.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hail, Cosmonauts!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "First, we would like to express our heartfelt gratitude to every player who has accompanied Cubic Cosmos on this journey. Since the official release, we have received a tremendous amount of enthusiastic feedback and suggestions. Every piece of feedback from you has helped us continuously clarify the direction for game optimization. Today, we are excited to introduce the first major version update after 1.0: Version 1.1.0, with many features stemming from your expectations and suggestions.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This time, we've added a brand new skill for War Wraith, introduced the Card Replacement feature, added a batch of new cards and new monsters, and enhanced multiple cards. See below for the complete update details:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added the 2nd hero skill, Assault, for War Spirit; added the corresponding starting deck.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added Card Replacement feature: Use new cards or improved versions of old cards to replace old cards in the card pool.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added 8 new class cards.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added 6 improved versions of old cards.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added 1 new monster, Indigo Crow.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Enhanced cards: Meow Meow, Social Butterfly, Mysterious Prayer, and Ceaseless Malice.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "The number of disabled hero skills in Act III has been adjusted from 5 to 6.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue where new cards unlocked in Act III were not added to archetype packs.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed the skill description error for Suffering Vigilant.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue where interface interactions might become abnormal after viewing derivative cards in the event interface.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue where restarting a battle during the shuffle animation of cards entering the deck might cause animation abnormalities.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue where the refresh button might disappear after performing specific operations in the Shop.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue where green frame effects on cards in hand might persist incorrectly.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Optimized some animation details.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "From Early Access to the official 1.0 release, and now to today's version 1.1.0, every step has been inseparable from the companionship and support of all our players. In the future, we will continue to make Cubic Cosmos even better with your trust and support.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Once again, thank you all for your continued support!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45444613/a7d63f65ef7dc61e22366f790fe88b3628e00ed5.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
